OL,3,GNEWSA'What terminal cancer has taught
OL,4,Ame about life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith a limited time left ahead of him,
OL,7,FRex has been looking back on his life
OL,8,Fand considering what advice he would
OL,9,Fpass on.
